    "description": {
      "content": "The Apache Whimsy Public Data API provides access to publicly available information about the Apache Software Foundation's organizational structure. It exposes data about committees, members, committers, and ICLA (Individual Contributor License Agreement) information. The data is maintained by the ASF Secretary and Whimsy tooling.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Apache Software Foundation",
